('loja_0078', 'Thirsty Brasserie', 'Culver’s Restaurant was founded by the Culver family in 1984, which eventually branched out to more than 300 franchised restaurants all over the US. Culver’s is well-known for its ButterBurger, which made the restaurant extremely famous. They also have other items which include salads, sandwiches, desserts, etc.', 'Brasileira', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0078/400', false, 6.64, 29, 49, 4.9, 1276, 'Ponte Nicole Roriz', '7113', 'Ourém', 'DF', '29681488', 57.01369704, -87.56196613, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
