('loja_0103', 'Spice Sushi', 'Culver’s Restaurant was founded by the Culver family in 1984, which eventually branched out to more than 300 franchised restaurants all over the US. Culver’s is well-known for its ButterBurger, which made the restaurant extremely famous. They also have other items which include salads, sandwiches, desserts, etc.', 'Saudável', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0103/400', false, 13.39, 20, 34, 3.7, 1475, 'Avenida Isabelly', '578', 'Castelo Branco', 'RR', '75477459', 14.53813184, -99.95143066, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
