('loja_0167', 'Smokestack Burger', 'Delhaize Group will achieve leading positions in food retailing in key mature and emerging markets. We accomplish our goal by developing strong regional companies benefiting from and contributing to the Groups strength, expertise and successful practices. Delhaize Group goes to market with a variety of food store formats. The Group is committed to offer a locally differentiated shopping experience to its customers in each of its markets, to deliver superior value and to maintain high social, environmental and ethical standards.', 'Lanches', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0167/400', false, 8.46, 17, 32, 3.7, 1666, 'Marginal Maria Sophia Camacho', '4993', 'Santa Maria da Feira', 'AM', '76836506', -23.04136121, 163.13768496, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0168', 'Blue Plate Pub', 'Our Mission at Denny’s is to establish beneficial business relationships with diverse suppliers who share our commitment to customer service, quality and competitive pricing.', 'Brasileira', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0168/400', true, 14.18, 25, 43, 3.5, 1276, 'Rodovia Miguel', 's/n', 'Estremoz', 'MA', '11408400', -32.02347019, 31.53214238, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0169', 'Sweet Spoon', 'We are committed to using the finest ingredients in our recipes. No food leaves our kitchen that we ourselves would not eat.', 'Italiana', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0169/400', true, 14.22, 15, 27, 3.7, 439, 'Rua Yango Carvalho', '027', 'Viseu', 'ES', '75689556', 74.95700449, 87.20258029, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0170', 'Belly Subs', 'To ensure that each guest receives prompt, professional, friendly and courteous service. To maintain a clean, comfortable and well maintained premises for our guests and staff. To provide at a fair price – nutritional, well-prepared meals – using only quality ingredients. To ensure that all guests and staff are treated with the respect and dignity they deserve. To thank each guest for the opportunity to serve them. By maintaining these objectives we shall be assured of a fair profit that will allow us to contribute to the community we serve.', 'Italiana', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0170/400', true, 6.23, 19, 31, 4.3, 1839, 'Travessa Yango Passarinho', '0330', 'Lagos', 'RR', '81706068', 59.86505108, 99.76946830, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0171', 'Sweet Bakery', 'To achieve and maintain such distinction in food and wine, service, atmosphere and setting that the restaurant gains a first class reputation for gastronomy, gracious and informed hospitality, comfort and beauty which draws new and repeat customers year after year. To achieve the above whilst upholding staff policies and practices which promote a fair and positive working environment. To be aware of and act on our responsibilities as a good corporate citizen to  provide a safe, clean and attractive place for guests to enjoy and for employees to work in - ensure ecologically sound management practices at the restaurant and in our surrounding gardens and woods - undertake meaningful involvement of Restaurant Les Fougères in selected charitable activities in our community and region.', 'Brasileira', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0171/400', false, 3.85, 22, 43, 3.7, 572, 'Ponte Bianca', '001', 'Espinho', 'PA', '58418425', -82.41206890, -97.60430565, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
