('loja_0304', '205 Subs', 'SVIs mission is to deliver quality products at affordable prices to our independent retailers, wholesalers and food service partners around the world by providing international procurement, distribution, marketing and supply chain management.', 'Saudável', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0304/400', false, 9.32, 17, 30, 3.8, 244, 'Avenida Allana da Fronteira', '460', 'Entroncamento', 'AL', '71872268', 2.47389945, 163.39476571, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0305', '03 Gastropub', 'Our mission is to be a leader in the distribution and merchandising of food, pharmacy, health and personal care items, seasonal merchandise, and related products and services. We place considerable importance on forging strong supplier partnerships. Our suppliers, large or small, local or global, are essential components in accomplishing our mission.', 'Saudável', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0305/400', false, 10.50, 17, 32, 3.2, 739, 'Marginal Mariana Xavier', '376', 'Senhora da Hora', 'AL', '56945738', -70.45144647, -42.96767178, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0306', 'Blue Plate BBQ', 'Delhaize Group will achieve leading positions in food retailing in key mature and emerging markets. We accomplish our goal by developing strong regional companies benefiting from and contributing to the Groups strength, expertise and successful practices. Delhaize Group goes to market with a variety of food store formats. The Group is committed to offer a locally differentiated shopping experience to its customers in each of its markets, to deliver superior value and to maintain high social, environmental and ethical standards.', 'Saudável', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0306/400', true, 12.47, 28, 49, 3.7, 713, 'Avenida Maria Luiza da Penha', 's/n', 'Moura', 'PI', '95728209', -68.06463721, -22.89152353, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0307', 'Silver Bakery', 'Culver’s Restaurant was founded by the Culver family in 1984, which eventually branched out to more than 300 franchised restaurants all over the US. Culver’s is well-known for its ButterBurger, which made the restaurant extremely famous. They also have other items which include salads, sandwiches, desserts, etc.', 'Pizza', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0307/400', true, 9.08, 16, 30, 4.6, 1219, 'Rodovia Thomas', '15325', 'Fundão', 'RO', '31747793', -81.18742080, 57.16226223, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0308', 'Golden Burger', 'Culver’s Restaurant was founded by the Culver family in 1984, which eventually branched out to more than 300 franchised restaurants all over the US. Culver’s is well-known for its ButterBurger, which made the restaurant extremely famous. They also have other items which include salads, sandwiches, desserts, etc.', 'Saudável', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0308/400', true, 11.73, 19, 32, 3.7, 485, 'Ponte Ana', '3123', 'Sabugal', 'MS', '21358230', -79.25146839, -179.84623810, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0309', 'Orange Creamery', 'To sell delicious and remarkable food and drinks. That the food and drink we sell meets the highest standards of quality, freshness and seasonality and combines both modern-creative and traditional southern styles of cooking. To consistently provide our customers with impeccable service by demonstrating warmth, graciousness, efficiency, knowledge, professionalism and integrity in our work. To have every customer who comes through our doors leave impressed by Maxie’s and excited to come back again. To create and maintain a restaurant that is comprehensive and exceptional in its attention to every detail of operation. To provide all who work with us a friendly, cooperative and rewarding environment which encourages long- term, satisfying, growth employment. To keep our concept fresh, exciting and on the cutting edge of the hospitality and entertainment industry. To be a giving member of the Ithaca community and to use our restaurant to improve the quality of life in the Finger Lakes region.', 'Saudável', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0309/400', true, 8.28, 17, 34, 4.1, 1417, 'Alameda Fabiano Quaresma', '275', 'Vila Nova de Gaia', 'RJ', '03733145', 59.85530088, 41.21478903, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
