('loja_0540', 'Smokestack Creamery', 'SVIs mission is to deliver quality products at affordable prices to our independent retailers, wholesalers and food service partners around the world by providing international procurement, distribution, marketing and supply chain management.', 'Japonesa', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0540/400', true, 11.10, 28, 47, 4.2, 645, 'Alameda Murilo', '140', 'Mêda', 'TO', '56971092', 40.56407136, 65.50264399, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0541', 'Fast Shakes', 'Delhaize Group will achieve leading positions in food retailing in key mature and emerging markets. We accomplish our goal by developing strong regional companies benefiting from and contributing to the Groups strength, expertise and successful practices. Delhaize Group goes to market with a variety of food store formats. The Group is committed to offer a locally differentiated shopping experience to its customers in each of its markets, to deliver superior value and to maintain high social, environmental and ethical standards.', 'Japonesa', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0541/400', true, 2.44, 21, 31, 4.9, 1485, 'Marginal Letícia', '01136', 'Lordelo', 'RN', '57699759', 78.16859821, 10.92393682, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
('loja_0542', 'Sugar Curry', 'To ensure that each guest receives prompt, professional, friendly and courteous service. To maintain a clean, comfortable and well maintained premises for our guests and staff. To provide at a fair price – nutritional, well-prepared meals – using only quality ingredients. To ensure that all guests and staff are treated with the respect and dignity they deserve. To thank each guest for the opportunity to serve them. By maintaining these objectives we shall be assured of a fair profit that will allow us to contribute to the community we serve.', 'Japonesa', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/loja_0542/400', false, 9.87, 18, 30, 5.0, 1609, 'Avenida Lorenzo', '788', 'São Pedro do Sul', 'RN', '43634247', -40.67164136, -106.64310982, NULL, '11:00 - 23:00', 'Fechado', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00', '11:00 - 23:00'),
